WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
From standing, hinge at the hips and fold forward with a long spine.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Let the head hang heavy and bend the knees as needed.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Rest hands on the floor, blocks, or opposite elbows.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Release the neck and breathe into the back of the legs.
